<title>USA: Seattle-Chinatown International Dist repriced.</title>
<headline>Seattle-Chinatown International Dist repriced.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Piper Jaffrary Inc said it repriced $9 million of Seattle-Chinatown International District Preservation and Development Authority, Wash., special obligation bonds, Series 1996, limited general obligation of City of Seattle.</p>
<p>The bonds are expected to be rated Aa1 by Moody's Investors Service and AA-plus by Standard &amp; Poor's Corp.</p>
<p>The bonds are dated 9/15/1996 and the first coupon is 2/1/1997.</p>
<p>The bonds are due 8/1.</p>
<p>The bonds are callable 8/1/2006 at 100.00.  </p>
